        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>You know how some mobile games are really good, but playing them on your phone kind of sucks after a while? The tiny screen hurts your eyes, you\u2019re constantly carrying around a charger to keep your battery up, and the controls can often be awkward. Well, <a href=\"https://play.google.com/googleplaygames\">Google Play Games</a> is a great way to fix all that.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Basically, it lets you play Android games directly on your computer. You don\u2019t have to worry about glitchy emulators or sketchy downloads either\u2014it\u2019s an official Google app.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You sign in with your Google account, download games like you normally would, and everything syncs automatically. So, if you\u2019ve already been playing something on your phone, you can pick it up on your PC right where you left off. Personally, it feels like Google is secretly telling me that I should be playing even ",
